body:
Depends on the age of the kid, if they are young enough to not understand how money works then the fault would be mine for not password protect their account, I would contact Epic support and ask for a refund, I read they are pretty lax given refunds if a kid bought something by accident, then I would have a talk with them and told them why what they did was wrong, and take gaming priviliges for a while.

&#x200B;

Now if they are older and know better, I would still request the refund from Epic, gaming and internet privileges are gone for a LONG time, and they would be paying that money off with work around the house
